  "notable_quotes": [
    "X-ray electron density and anharmonicity modeling indicate Cd–triazole bonds and hydrogen bonds promote the single-atom libration driving anomalous expansion.",
    "Cd(1,2,4-triazole)2(H2PO4)2 (Cd-Tz) shows near-zero thermal expansion from 25 K to 400 K, an unusual broad-temperature nZTE response in a 2D coordination polymer.",
    "Minor Zn or Mn substitution in Cd-Tz (~8/12%) shifts the thermal response prominently from near-zero thermal expansion to negative thermal expansion."
